      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think that's an awful, terrible idea.\nThe safety system is in place to give the user control over how they see avatar features, it should never ever be used as a \"social credit score\" and stop other people from joining public instances.\nYou can simply turn off player voice and avatar on visitors and you'll have your problem solved of not having to interact with them. Worst case you'll have to block if they keep getting in your face.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
