      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: But simply blocking them wont stop them from joining karaoke/movie/anime/music worlds and trolling. most of the player base is always in private worlds because of random toxic visitor level users that don't care about the game at all. its already a quote \"social credit score\" if your using it to completely block them out anyways with the \"you can simply turn off player voice and avatar on visitors and you'll have your problem solved of not having to interact with them.\" I don't see why the idea is terrible. It should just be an option just like \"friend/Friends+/invite only\" are. not all public lobbies would be like this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
