  "details": "I think it would be a great idea to implement something with the trust system to be able to make public world instances where you can set it so only user with the allowed trust levels can join. There are way to many users ranging from visitor-user trust levels that just don't care about the game and join worlds to troll people and if this was implemented it would limit the amount of stupidity people have to go through.",
